This only happens to me with spellcasters, and only if I start out
spellcasting. Nowadays I wear all uncursed armor, engrave Elbereth,
and let my pet handle the fights. Even if I don't find food, I only
get hungry to the point of "Weak"ness often enough that I can pray and
my god will help me out. This strategy is also highly compatible with
the protection racket -- I just can't pass up cheap deals!

If you are playing combat classes, kill and eat at will, and you
should not go hungry. Some elements of the above strategy can work
well for those classes too, though.

